{"text":"Number one, then we add in technology. There's a chemical in our body called dopamine. Dopamine is responsible for the feelings we get when we find something we're looking for or we accomplish something we set out to accomplish. You know that great feeling you get when you cross something off your to-do list? When you win the game, when you hit the target, right? Win the client, get the promotion, whatever it is. That elation, find your keys. That elation comes from a chemical in our body called dopamine. Now other substances, other things that release dopamine include alcohol, nicotine, gambling. That's what makes us feel good when we engage with those things and it's the root of a lot of addiction. In fact, almost every alcoholic on the planet discovered alcohol when they were teenagers. You see, when we're very, very young, the only approval we need is approval from our parents.","words":[{"text":"Number","start":0.0,"end":0.8},{"text":"one","start":0.8,"end":1.14,"punct":","},{"text":"then","start":2.16,"end":2.36},{"text":"we","start":2.36,"end":2.54},{"text":"add","start":2.54,"end":2.84},{"text":"in","start":2.84,"end":3.1},{"text":"technology","start":3.1,"end":3.84,"punct":"."},{"text":"There's","start":4.98,"end":5.22},{"text":"a","start":5.22,"end":5.32},{"text":"chemical","start":5.32,"end":5.5},{"text":"in","start":5.5,"end":5.7},{"text":"our","start":5.7,"end":5.84},{"text":"body","start":5.84,"end":6.04},{"text":"called","start":6.04,"end":6.26},{"text":"dopamine","start":6.26,"end":6.64,"punct":"."},{"text":"Dopamine","start":7.52,"end":7.84},{"text":"is","start":7.84,"end":8.02},{"text":"responsible","start":8.02,"end":8.44},{"text":"for","start":8.44,"end":8.76},{"text":"the","start":8.76,"end":8.9},{"text":"feelings","start":8.9,"end":9.2},{"text":"we","start":9.2,"end":9.44},{"text":"get","start":9.44,"end":9.74},{"text":"when","start":9.74,"end":10.14},{"text":"we","start":10.14,"end":10.24},{"text":"find","start":10.24,"end":10.54},{"t